  "body": "Closes #801\n\nClaim: cloud/i801b-sonnet\n\n**Problem.** After #841 the App job is red again on dev-swift (run 43178983169, job 131050089696): 4 tests fail (`VideoPlayerSheetTests` x2, `ReaderInsetsWebTests.aDocumentStoppedBeforeItWasReadyLoadsAgainWhenShownAgain`, `ReaderPresenceWebTests.aDisappearanceBeforeTheWindowLeavesAndTheWindowBringsTheReaderBack`), and plain model tests such as `TopicReaderModelWaitTests` and `ModeratorAlertModelTests` take 310-360 s each.\n\n**Cause.** The tests run in simulator clones (\"Clone 1 of iPhone 18 Pro\") on one runner. Pure model tests that should take milliseconds take 270-360 s, so the clones starve each other; the web-view tests, which need real WebKit time, hit their timeouts. The test phase took 969.7 s (`Testing started completed`).\n\n**Change.** One flag in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`: `-parallel-testing-enabled NO` on the \"Build and test on the simulator (unsigned)\" step. This is the least invasive option: no test plan, no worker count to tune, no test code touched. The 45-minute step timeout from #841 stays; a green run was about 16 minutes before the clones, and serial runs should stay well under 45 minutes, to be confirmed by the first run.\n\n**Evidence.** Before: job 131050089696 red, tests phase 969.7 s, 4 failures, model tests 270-360 s each. After: to be reported here from the first ready run.\n\nNo test is skipped, disabled or loosened. No ledger entry.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CHRbWfvTFaXHkRxKkw)_",
